error[E0305]: type Optional<Owner> has no member 'name'
  --> $DIR/optional-chain-member.nra:12:40
   |
12 | let name = func(pet: Pet) -> string => pet?.owner.name;
   |                                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ an optional access gives an Optional
